  "body": "- 支持 riscv64 架构\r\n- 增加 zygote-blacklist ，允许停止注入某些 zygote （通过 WebUI 开关或 `znctl zygote-blacklist` 命令设置）\r\n- 修复 Android 17 QPR2 支持\r\n- 适配开启 CONFIG_PROC_MEM_FORCE_PTRACE 的内核\r\n- 修复一些其他问题\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n- Added support for the riscv64 architecture\r\n- Added a zygote blacklist to allow disabling injection into specific zygotes (configurable via the WebUI toggle or the `znctl zygote-blacklist` command)\r\n- Fixed support for Android 17 QPR2\r\n- Added compatibility for kernels with `CONFIG_PROC_MEM_FORCE_PTRACE` enabled\r\n- Fixed various other issues\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nSHA256: 17c506ffea119f03e5e9d9c70acd400efdd804f35d8968d0d56a5d66fea9f3ab",
